WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.694
Imposter is a word game for three to ten players. Everyone knows the secret word, except one person.

2
00:00:08.394 --> 00:00:13.280
Tap your card to peek at your word. The imposter only gets to see the category.

3
00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:22.482
Then you take turns giving a one-word clue. Be vague enough that the imposter can't work out the word, but specific enough that your friends believe you.

4
00:00:23.182 --> 00:00:28.589
After the clues, you talk it over, and everyone votes for who they think the imposter is.

5
00:00:28.739 --> 00:00:34.167
If the imposter gets caught, they still get one guess at the secret word to steal the win.

6
00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:41.028
Imposters score three points for escaping. The crew scores one, plus one for voting right.
